fact WorkItem(id: "WI-572", description: some(value: "WI-502 Step 3 — Static type on the carrier + read API. Stop dropping NodeOccurrence.inferred_type on De Bruijn open / substitution (the original WI-502 bug). Implement min_sort / type-read = deref-binding-then-read-carrier-cache (M3/M6: binding is navigation, not caching; the cache lives on the value carrier, never on the shared TermId / binding edge), falling back to the store (Step 1 constraints) for an unbound-but-constrained var. Add the compute-once entry: widen the typing boundary to the prove/simplify entry (untyped today). Add the LOUD refresh boundary where σ cannot link the types vars (surface, never silent drift). A bare Value::Term read for its type needs the (type,inner) pair wrapper or it recomputes. See docs/design/constrained-term-substrate.md Step 3. Acceptance: cargo-test green via scripts/test.sh."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: ["WI-571"]), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: Delivered(agent: "user", at: "2026-06-26T20:11:01Z"))

fact Tag(workitem: "WI-572", name: "wi502")

fact Feedback(workitem: "WI-572", author: "user", content: "DELIVERED 9119c41 (core A+B; suite 2338). USER chose \"core now, defer C+E\". (A) carry inferred_type through open/subst/reassemble via new NodeOccurrence::rebuilt_expr (preserves Synthesized origin + stamped type); VERBATIM carry sound because min_sort reads only the functor-determined SORT HEAD (invariant under child-subst param refinement; var-head=None never stale — M6). (B) min_sort_of_value(kb,σ,value): var→σ-binding deref (CYCLE-GUARDED loop — SLD σ not occurs-checked) → carrier cache; Node→inferred_type; scalar→literal-kind (try_resolve_symbol short name); unbound-constrained→Step-1 store (type_constraints_of). Bare Value::Term→None. /code-review (2 finders): carry-soundness clean (no stale-concrete case; narrowed heads = sound upper bounds); FIXED a confirmed stack-overflow on cyclic σ (cycle guard + test). DEFERRED to Step 5 (WI-292): (C) compute-once entry = re-type the untyped apply_eq_rules prove/simplify entry (its TermId redex carries no stamp); (E) Value::Term (type,inner) wrapper (NOT a Value::Typed variant — 1844 Value:: arms/WI-538 trap — a narrow external pair at the boundary); and store_sort_bound pin-vs-upper-bound semantics. Still write-mostly: min_sort_of_value has no production caller; carry inert today (typer Stamp frame runs after reassemble).", at: "2026-06-26T20:11:00Z")

fact Feedback(workitem: "WI-572", author: "claude", content: "SUPERSEDED-IN-PART (post-2026-06-27 session): the delivered min_sort_of_value read API is slated for REMOVAL by WI-578 (typed-VALUE carrier) -- the converged model replaces the source-less min_sort 'pull' (returns None on constructed values) with a (type,TermId) pair + typed(value,env). The CARRY half (rebuilt_expr carrying inferred_type through open/subst) STAYS. min_sort_of_value is inert (no production caller), so its removal in WI-578 breaks nothing.", at: "2026-06-27T20:29:01Z")
